    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet in the peaceful, coastal setting of Loughshinny, this impressive four-bedroom detached bungalow is presented in excellent condition throughout. Offering generous accommodation, beautifully landscaped private gardens and a fully self-contained annex, the property provides exceptional flexibility for modern family life.\n\nThe bungalow is well laid out, with a bright open-plan living space enjoying a south-westerly aspect. There are four bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from French doors to the garden, alongside a family bathroom and excellent hallway storage. The property also features new double and triple-glazed windows and new shutters throughout.\n\nThe private front and rear gardens combine mature planting, lawn and patio areas, creating lovely spaces for relaxing and entertaining.\n\nThe separate annex is a real bonus, comprising a main office/living space, storage room, bathroom and bedroom. It offers excellent flexibility for working from home, independent family accommodation, guests or other uses.\n\nPublic transport is within walking distance, with the area served by the 33 bus route, while Skerries and Rush & Lusk train stations are just a short drive away."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.88m x 4.79m\nWith tiled walls & flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 5.20m x 7.20m\nWith wood flooring, a deep box bay window, a multi-fuel stove, and French doors leading to the rear garden.\n\nDining Area - 3.20m x 3.35m\nWith wood flooring and French doors leading to the rear garden.\n\nKitchen - 3.12m x 3.85m\nWith wood flooring, recessed lighting, ample storage, a newly fitted kitchen.\n\nLaundry - 1.54m x 1.38m\nWall and floor tiles.\n\nHall - 5.77m x 2.58m\nWith wood flooring, recessed lighting, a waterfall feature, ample storage, and access to the attic.\n\nOffice - 2.21m x 3.09m\nWith wood flooring.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.74m x 2.62m\nWith wood flooring, recessed lighting, and French doors leading to the rear garden.\n\nWalk in closet - 2.47m x 4.22m\nWith wood flooring.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 3.02m x 1.73\nFully tiled, with W.C., W.H.B., and shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.02m x 2.74m\nWith wood flooring and recessed lighting.\n\nAnnex - \n\n\nKitchen / Living - \nWith wood effect tiled flooring, recessed lighting, an integrated oven, hob and extractor fan, and window shutters.\n\nBedroom - 3.80m x 2.77m\nWith wood flooring.\n\nBathroom - 3.07m x 1.36m\nWith tiled flooring and shower, W.C., and W.H.B.\n\nOutside - \nThe property benefits from a private wraparound garden, with the front and rear gardens featuring a mixture of mature planted borders, lawn and patio areas.\n\n"
      },
      {
